{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6a393d23-e112-8e72-8719-22ab59a2d73e",
  "created_at": "2026-02-06T12:35:58-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Deirdre Donovan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:33:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:33:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. I want to report a dip in the road. Near my house. Where utility trench was dug."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:34:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a dip where a utility trench was. Can you give me the location?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:34:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 475 Malbone Road. In front of the house, by the curb side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:34:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "475 Malbone Road. And what does it look like? Is it a hole, or more of a sunken area?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:34:22-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not a hole. The trench settled, so now there is long dip. Maybe three meters. [pause] Sorry, one moment. I am sweeping kitchen floor and the broom hit the wall. Okay, I am back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:34:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. So a long sunken strip, about three meters, in front of 475 Malbone Road, where the trench was filled in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:34:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. Cars go over it and bounce. My car hit it yesterday, hard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:34:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm sorry to hear that. Was there any damage?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:34:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do not know yet. I will check the tire and the front. My question is, does the city reimburse car damage? If there is damage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:35:01-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's handled as a claim, it's not something I can approve from this desk. I can take your information and make sure the right office gets it to you. Keep any repair estimates and receipts, and take a photo of the dip if you can."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:35:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I will take photo. And how long repairs usually take? For this kind of dip."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:35:22-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It varies. In winter the crews are limited by the weather, and patching can wait for warmer days, but a dip like that usually gets looked at and marked sooner. I'll put it in as a road condition at 475 Malbone Road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:35:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. You need my phone number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:35:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:35:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0154. Name is Deirdre Donovan."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:35:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Deirdre Donovan, 401-555-0154. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:35:46-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:35:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All set. I'll send this over today. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:35:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T12:35:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
